1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.782
Perimeter with units

2
00:00:01.782 --> 00:00:29.109
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Perimeter with units. Perimeter kisi band shape ke sab side lengths ka total hota hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:29.109 --> 00:01:03.564
5 cm aur 3 cm sides wale rectangle ka perimeter 5 + 3 + 5 + 3, yaani 16 cm hai. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:03.564 --> 00:01:36.238
Notebook par rectangle banao, har side naapkar addition ke saath unit bhi likho. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

5
